WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.932
During COVID-19, clinicians were treating infection in patients

00:00:04.932 --> 00:00:09.314
who also lived with hypertension and chronic medication exposure.

00:00:12.675 --> 00:00:18.145
Soluble ACE2 and angiotensin II are distinct measurements

00:00:18.145 --> 00:00:23.614
in the renin-angiotensin system. Their interpretation requires clinical context.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:33.949
Our 2022 publication investigated reported differences in those

00:00:33.949 --> 00:00:40.348
levels among hypertensive COVID-19 patients receiving different antihypertensive medications.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.087
Medication groups, disease severity and confounding factors matter. A

00:00:49.087 --> 00:00:53.374
measured level does not reveal the entire causal pathway.

00:00:56.633 --> 00:01:01.612
A signal in a patient cohort motivates mechanistic investigation. It

00:01:01.612 --> 00:01:06.590
should not become an unsupported instruction to stop or change medication.

00:01:10.258 --> 00:01:15.522
The source article contains the study design and results. This

00:01:15.522 --> 00:01:20.785
film explains the uncertainty around clinical association rather than prescribing care.
